        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>PALLU</strong> separated, the second son of Reuben (1 Chronicles 5:3); called Phallu, Genesis 46:9. He was the father of the Phalluites (Exodus 6:14; Numbers 26:5, 8).",
