        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>ALEMETH</strong> covering. (1.) One of the nine sons of Becher, the son of Benjamin (1 Chronicles 7:8). (2.) One of the sons of Jehoadah, or Jarah, son of Ahaz (1 Chronicles 8:36). (3.) A sacerdotal city of Benjamin (1 Chronicles 6:60), called also Almon (Joshua 21:18), now Almit, a mile north-east of the ancient Anathoth.",
