        "dict-easton",
        "Dictionary",
        "Easton.",
        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>MAHAZIOTH</strong> visions, a Kohathite Levite, chief of the twenty-third course of musicians (1 Chronicles 25:4, 30).",
        "Easton's Illustrated Bible Dictionary, M. G. Easton (1897). Public domain.",
