        "Easton.",
        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>ROMAMTI-EZER</strong> elevation of help, one of the sons of Heman, “the king’s seer in the words of God, to lift up the horn.” He was head of the “four-and-twentieth” course of singers (1 Chronicles 25:4, 31).",
        "Easton's Illustrated Bible Dictionary, M. G. Easton (1897). Public domain.",
