        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>JEHOZABAD</strong> Jehovah-given. (1.) The son of Obed-edom (1 Chronicles 26:4), one of the Levite porters. (2.) The son of Shomer, one of the two conspirators who put king Jehoash to death in Millo in Jerusalem (2 Kings 12:21). (3.) 2 Chronicles 17:18.",
