        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>AZMAVETH</strong> strong as death. (1.) One of David’s thirty warriors (2 Samuel 23:31). (2.) An overseer over the royal treasury in the time of David and Solomon (1 Chronicles 27:25). (3.) A town in the tribe of Judah, near Jerusalem (Nehemiah 12:29; Ezra 2:24). (4.) 1 Chronicles 8:36",
